    "turn_text": "Guys, this is an episode you do not want to miss. I'm with my former opponent for Congress, Congressman Lance Gooden. If you've read my book, Jesus in Politics, One Woman's Walk with God in a Mud Slinging Profession, I unveil my soul. I tell you what failure looks like. Yes, I'm a failure. No. Really, God has a purpose and a plan for everything. And I'm with my former opponent as we talk about campaigning, as we talk about how hard it was for our families, as we talk about overcoming offenses, bitterness, and unforgiveness, and also the wisdom that needs to come for all of us as we engage in our communities. Congressman Lance Gooden served in the 5th District of Texas since 2018 until he beat me in that runoff. He's been elected several times. He's served on the House Financial Services Committee. He serves on the judicial committee right now. And we are just so blessed to have him. And you're going to love this episode with Congressman Lance Gooden. Stick around. Welcome to the Conversations with Christians Engaged Podcast. I'm your host, Bunny-Pounds, the President of Christians Engaged. This ministry exists to awaken, motivate, educate, and empower ordinary believers in Jesus Christ to do three things, to pray for our elected officials and our nation regularly, to vote in every election to impact our culture. and to engage in some form of civic, education, or involvement for the well-being of our nation. So thank Full Bunny for what you do. A lot of people talk to talk, but you really walk the",
