    "turn_text": "Yeah, that's good. I remember somebody when I was about to run, and here I had been a political consultant and ran campaigns, right? Worked for Congressman Hinsley and others, but they told me the first thing you're going to think about in the morning at 5 a.m. is this campaign. And the last thing you're going to think about at 11 p.m. when you go to sleep is this campaign. I thought, surely not. I would have some sort of balance. I've had balance in politics all this time. No, they were absolutely true. It's all consuming,",
